// Sign small payments without asking; confirm anything bigger as usual.
//
// The threshold is measured on what actually leaves the wallet
// (`external_out_total`), so change coming back to the account does not count
// towards it. 100000 sat = 0.001 BTC.
//
// Silent approval is only honored when every key signing the transaction also
// approves silently, and when all input amounts could be verified.
//
// Note that the fee is not looked at: a host could still turn a small payment
// into an expensive transaction. See spending-limits.plc for a variant that
// caps it too.
if context.external_out_total <= 100000 { approve(); }
